The engines Plumbus drives carry their own terms, which this licence does not
cover and cannot override:

  TRELLIS 2        MIT, but its default background remover (RMBG-2.0) is
                   CC BY-NC 4.0. Swap it for BiRefNet or rembg before shipping
                   anything commercial.
  Hunyuan3D 2.1    Tencent's own community licence. Read it before commercial
                   use; it is not MIT.
  DINOv3           Gated on Hugging Face, under Meta's terms.
  GPT Image 2      OpenAI API terms.
  fal.ai           fal's terms, billed per call.

Check each one against your intended use.
